    "code_example": "Map<String, Usuario> map = new HashMap<>(16, 0.75f);\nmap.put(\"u100\", new Usuario(\"Ana\"));\n// En colision severa, el bucket conmuta de LinkedList a TreeNode (Red-Black Tree)",
